  "Puoi salvare il contratto in bozza e completare cliente, quota economica, IVA e pagamenti dopo la conferma. La bozza non genera ricavi o rate.": "You can save the contract as a draft and complete customer, financial share, VAT and payments after confirmation. The draft doesn't generate revenue or instalments.",
